  · Write {"file_path":"/Users/kevin.hartman/code/stockflow-sprint2-design-ready/.consort/features/F6-split-tracking-code/stories/S2-contract-schema/story.json","content":"{\n  \"id\": \"S2-contract-schema\",\n  \"asA\": \"warehouse operator\",\n  \"iWantTo\": \"have inventory_code dropped from the stock table, with a proven reversible down migration that reconstructs it\",\n  \"soThat\": \"the schema contract is complete and no combined opaque code remains\",\n  \"independence\": {\n    \"distinct_from_prior\": true,\n    \"rationale\": \"S1 ends with inventory_code still present and batch/serial added alongside it; S2 is the separate contract step that physically removes inventory_code — S1 can be fully built and deployed while inventory_code still exists, leaving S2 genuinely unbuilt\"\n  }\n}\n"}
